<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese money supply rises in March.</title>
<headline>Portuguese money supply rises in March.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese money supply, as measured by &quot;aggregate 'L-&quot;, roughly equivalent to M3, rose 9.6 percent in March, compared with 8.7 percent in February, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p> Percentage change	  March 97	  February 1997</p>
<p> Aggregate 'L-'		+9.6		 +8.7</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
